hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"224","Al-Hussein bin Issa Al-Bistami narrated to us, Abd Al-Samad bin Abd Al-Warith narrated to me, my father narrated to me, he said: Hussein Al-Mu’allim narrated to me, Yahya narrated to me Ibn Abi Kathir, that Abu Salamah, narrated to him, that Ata’ bin Yasar, narrated to him, that Yazid bin Khalid Al-Juhani, narrated to him, that he asked Othman bin Affan, on the authority of a man who has intercourse but does not ejaculate, said: “He does not have to wash.” Then Othman said: I heard it from the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. He said: After that, I asked Ali bin Abi Talib, Al-Zubayr bin Al-Awwam, Talha bin Ubaid Allah, and Ubayy bin Ka’b, and they said: For example That. Abu Salamah said: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr told me that he asked Abu Ayyub al-Ansari, and he said something like that, on the authority of the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him. He said hello"
